  = note: each `<send>` property (event, target, type, delay, and the send ID as `id` or `idlocation`) has one literal and one computed form; supplying both is ambiguous
  = help: keep exactly one of `event` or `eventexpr`
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>
help: keep `event` and remove `eventexpr`
  |
